<title>USA: Isomedix names Masefield chief executive.</title>
<headline>Isomedix names Masefield chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>WHIPPANY 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Isomedix Inc said it has named its chairman John Masefield to the additional post of chief executive officer, effective immediately and succeeding Peter Mayer, who will remain as a board member and consultant to the company.</p>
<p>Masefield is the company's founder and served as chief executive from 1972 to 1995.</p>
</text>
